    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try to save the earth</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/a8de2b10c8fbec4f3b1ef2986d57f748.poster.avif?t=1754168003\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/a8de2b10c8fbec4f3b1ef2986d57f748.webm?t=1754168003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/a8de2b10c8fbec4f3b1ef2986d57f748.mp4?t=1754168003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>ClimaSave's <strong>Terraforming Environmental Restoration and Revival Androids</strong> (TERRAs) went rogue. What once was humanities last hope to life again on planet earth turned out to be the possible end for terrestrial live.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not all hope is lost</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/8958d17e47ee4308a091dcc7cbcb1341.poster.avif?t=1754168003\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/8958d17e47ee4308a091dcc7cbcb1341.apng?t=1754168003\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span><br>As a <strong>Simulation Specialist</strong> it is your task to find a way to stop the TERRAs and save the earth from its impending death. Jump into new procedurally generated simulations to find the one way to save the earth.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control and build your squad of robots</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/2619da8f0d686790d3c97562e79ef722.poster.avif?t=1754168003\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/2619da8f0d686790d3c97562e79ef722.apng?t=1754168003\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span><br>Fight with up to <strong>7 different robots</strong> against the TERRAs and try to stop them from destroying the earth even further. Customize your robots with different lasers and metal alloys to improve on their tactical strengths.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your resources</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/77eab66bc476ce67d6adb81e5eebd05e.poster.avif?t=1754168003\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/77eab66bc476ce67d6adb81e5eebd05e.apng?t=1754168003\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span><br>For every simulation you try, there is only a limited amount of resources you can use to repair or extend your squad. During each mission you can <strong>recycle destroyed units</strong>to stockpile more metal and survive the tactical battles until the TERRAs are defeated.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock different simulation loadouts</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/dcdbb17eaf4b8b6555482005ef5662a1.poster.avif?t=1754168003\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/dcdbb17eaf4b8b6555482005ef5662a1.apng?t=1754168003\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span><br>Every simulation will be different. So can be your squad that you start with. Show ClimaSave that you are capable of saving the earth to <strong>unlock new starting configurations</strong>. Each has its own strengths and weaknesses providing a different experience with every playthrough.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try to save the earth</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/a8de2b10c8fbec4f3b1ef2986d57f748.poster.avif?t=1754168003\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/a8de2b10c8fbec4f3b1ef2986d57f748.webm?t=1754168003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/a8de2b10c8fbec4f3b1ef2986d57f748.mp4?t=1754168003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>ClimaSave's <strong>Terraforming Environmental Restoration and Revival Androids</strong> (TERRAs) went rogue. What once was humanities last hope to life again on planet earth turned out to be the possible end for terrestrial live.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not all hope is lost</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/8958d17e47ee4308a091dcc7cbcb1341.poster.avif?t=1754168003\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/8958d17e47ee4308a091dcc7cbcb1341.apng?t=1754168003\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span><br>As a <strong>Simulation Specialist</strong> it is your task to find a way to stop the TERRAs and save the earth from its impending death. Jump into new procedurally generated simulations to find the one way to save the earth.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control and build your squad of robots</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/2619da8f0d686790d3c97562e79ef722.poster.avif?t=1754168003\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/2619da8f0d686790d3c97562e79ef722.apng?t=1754168003\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span><br>Fight with up to <strong>7 different robots</strong> against the TERRAs and try to stop them from destroying the earth even further. Customize your robots with different lasers and metal alloys to improve on their tactical strengths.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your resources</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/77eab66bc476ce67d6adb81e5eebd05e.poster.avif?t=1754168003\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/77eab66bc476ce67d6adb81e5eebd05e.apng?t=1754168003\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span><br>For every simulation you try, there is only a limited amount of resources you can use to repair or extend your squad. During each mission you can <strong>recycle destroyed units</strong>to stockpile more metal and survive the tactical battles until the TERRAs are defeated.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock different simulation loadouts</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/dcdbb17eaf4b8b6555482005ef5662a1.poster.avif?t=1754168003\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700680/extras/dcdbb17eaf4b8b6555482005ef5662a1.apng?t=1754168003\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span><br>Every simulation will be different. So can be your squad that you start with. Show ClimaSave that you are capable of saving the earth to <strong>unlock new starting configurations</strong>. Each has its own strengths and weaknesses providing a different experience with every playthrough.",
